{"id":"1c185b4536ca59db","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp.md","title":"最坏多项式时间与 RP 识别","display":"df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp — 最坏多项式时间与 RP 识别","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp","aliases":["73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp"],"display":"df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp — 最坏多项式时间与 RP 识别","depends_on":["[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]","[[73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.4 and §11.4.7, print pp. 506–510; PDF pp. 528–532","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp — 最坏多项式时间与 RP 识别"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"49440e374bb38c72\" href=\"?note=49440e374bb38c72\" title=\"73-df-random-acceptance-probability\">73-df-random-acceptance-probability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"29f67a62b22dd6a8\" href=\"?note=29f67a62b22dd6a8\" title=\"73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws\">73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.4 and §11.4.7, print pp. 506–510; PDF pp. 528–532"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>输入字母表固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2\">\\(\\mathbf2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选随机机，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。有效机器上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{M,w}\">\\(H_{M,w}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_M^a\">\\(\\Pr_M^a\\)</span> 采用已列依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RPoly}\">\\(\\mathsf{RPoly}\\)</span> 为下式给出的有类型机器类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RPoly}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}:\n\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;H_{M,w}(c(|w|+1)^d)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RPoly}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}:\n\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;H_{M,w}(c(|w|+1)^d)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\bigl[M=N\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;[(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)=0)\\land(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)\\ge\\tfrac12)]\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\bigl[M=N\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;[(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)=0)\\land(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)\\ge\\tfrac12)]\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{coRP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{RP}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{coRP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{RP}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限深度处停机概率为 1 等价于该深度的每个比特选择均已停机，因而是最坏时间界。正实例至少一半接受，负实例不可能接受；并非只要“存在一个接受分支”就属于 RP。全输入统一的 c,d 也覆盖空输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-acceptance-probability","status":"resolved","id":"49440e374bb38c72","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws","status":"resolved","id":"29f67a62b22dd6a8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-random-prefix-probability-laws]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"H_{M,w}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_M^a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RPoly}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RPoly}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\{R:\\operatorname{RandTM}_{\\mathbf2}(R)\\}:\n\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;H_{M,w}(c(|w|+1)^d)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\bigl[M=N\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;[(w\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)=0)\\land(w\\in L\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_N^a(w)\\ge\\tfrac12)]\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{RPoly}\\;\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{coRP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathsf{RP}\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]"},{"id":"5a60110ceb351b9d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp|最坏多项式时间与 RP 识别]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"8527287e791b6212","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da661bfc44ef4f5a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RPRec}(M,L)$，$k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$。$\\mathsf{RPoly},\\Pr^a$ 见 [[73-df-random-polynomial-time-and-rp]]。"},{"id":"0afef8eeccddc023","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["49440e374bb38c72","29f67a62b22dd6a8"]}